license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Independent experimental research representing the public NASA core Flight
  System (cFS) v7.0.1 source bundle and its 25 pinned Git-linked components as
  an SPDX 2.3 source-level inventory. Version 0.2 adds reconciliation against
  the official cFS Version Description Document package, a bounded Git-tree
  inventory, conservative dependency and license evidence, vulnerability
  research status, standards mapping, and external-discussion provenance. The
  reported VDD crosswalk found exact full-length Git revision agreement for 25
  of 25 components. The artifact does not build cFS and is not a build, binary,
  deployment, or runtime SBOM. Apache-2.0 applies only to covered original
  research material; SPDX data and third-party materials retain their
  separately documented terms. This is independent research and was not
  produced, sponsored, endorsed, certified, approved, or validated by NASA.
keywords:
  - software bill of materials
  - SBOM
  - SPDX 2.3
  - NASA cFS
